","target":"source-to-pay-integration-framework","line":24},{"title":"store","target":"https://store.servicenow.com/sn_appstore_store.do#!/store/application/8bf60c3b979a3510a4ffb1511153afa2/1.0.4?referer=%2Fstore%2Fsearch%3Flistingtype%3Dallintegrations%25253Bancillary_app%25253Bcertified_apps%25253Bcontent%25253Bindustry_solution%25253Boem%25253Butility%25253Btemplate%25253Bgenerative_ai%25253Bsnow_solution%26q%3Dfairmarkit&sl=sh","line":28},{"title":"Decision configuration for third-party sourcing","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/decision-config-third-party-sourcing.md","line":30},{"title":"Integration tables for third-party sourcing","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/integ-tables-third-party-sourcing.md","line":32},{"title":"pricing","target":"pricing","line":36},{"title":"Sourcing and Purchasing Automation","target":"purchase-experience-workflow","line":36},{"title":"negotiations","target":"negotiations","line":37},{"title":"purchase lines","target":"purchase-lines","line":37},{"title":"sourcing request","target":"sourcing-request","line":37},{"title":"supplier","target":"supplier","line":41},{"title":"Source-to-Pay Workspace","target":"purch-order-mgmt-ws","line":56},{"title":"Shopping Hub","target":"shopping-hub-overview","line":56},{"title":"Sourcing events","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/negotiation-events.md","line":61},{"title":"Negotiations","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/negotiations.md","line":61},{"title":"Sourcing request","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/sourcing-request.md","line":61},{"title":"Compare quotes and select a supplier","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/work-compare-quotes-todos.md","line":61},{"title":"Decision configuration for third-party sourcing","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/decision-config-third-party-sourcing.md","line":63},{"title":"Integration tables for third-party sourcing","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/integ-tables-third-party-sourcing.md","line":65},{"title":"Submit multi-product sourcing requests","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/multi-product-sourcing-intake-with-third-party-integration.md","line":67},{"title":"sourcing events","target":"negotiation-events","line":68},{"title":"Manage third-party RFx tasks in Employee Center","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/third-party-rfx-task-management-for-requestors.md","line":69},{"title":"Integrate Sourcing and Procurement Operations with other applications","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/source-to-pay-operations/sourcing-and-procurement-operations/integrating-spo.md","line":72},{"title":"Sourcing and Procurement Operations","target":"psm-overview","line":99},{"title":"Source-to-Pay integration framework","target":"source-to-pay-integration-framework","line":100},{"title":"Pricing","target":"pricing","line":101},{"title":"Sourcin